{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>And she called his name Moab... and she called his name Ben-Ammi.</b> To indicate that they did not conceive from an unfit man." "<b>He is the father of Moab. He is the father of the children of Ammon.</b> For they inherited land — because the women's intent was acceptable, their seed became two nations that inherited from Abraham in part, as the Sages said: בְּכָל דְּרָכֶיךָ דָעֵהוּ (Proverbs 3:6) — even for a transgression (Nazir 23b)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:51.704205096Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}